flowchart TB
    App["Security Agent source<br/>Shared engine, agent and API"]
    Scanner["Canonical marketplace plugin<br/>mcp-assessment + skill-assessment<br/>Pinned reviewed version"]
    Rules["Approved rules and mappings<br/>Pinned policy and reference versions"]

    App --> CI
    Scanner --> CI
    Rules --> CI
    CI["CI verification and compatibility tests<br/>Bind engine, plugin and rule versions<br/>Record each release artifact identity"]

    CI --> Image["Hosted release<br/>Immutable ECR image<br/>Engine, scanner plugin and rules"]
    Image --> Hosted["Hosted execution<br/>AgentCore Runtime with API<br/>Explicit trusted skill loading"]

    CI --> Package["Local release<br/>Versioned engine package and CLI<br/>Same scanner plugin and rules"]
    Package --> Local["Independent local execution<br/>Coding assistant installs scanner plugin<br/>Invokes the local engine CLI"]
    Local --> Report["Local report<br/>No AgentCore invocation required"]
